1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440
Hi, I'm Prince.

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:06,720
ReSupply AI helps small shop owners decide what
to restock, stay

3
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:12,000
within a budget, and track purchasing through
payment and stock receipt.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:21,000
This is an isolated demo shop with three
products and sixty synthetic sales days each.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Its stock and orders stay separate from the
existing shop.

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:31,615
Here, a real Random Forest forecasts daily
demand.

7
00:00:31,615 --> 00:00:36,231
It learns from recent sales and weekday
patterns.

8
00:00:36,231 --> 00:00:42,577
We test on later dates and compare against a
seven-day mean.

9
00:00:42,577 --> 00:00:50,654
We select the forest only when tested error is
at least five percent lower.

10
00:00:50,654 --> 00:00:53,538
Otherwise, we keep the mean.

11
00:00:53,538 --> 00:00:57,000
The owner reviews its purchase impact.

12
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:06,677
The planner combines demand with stock, supplier
lead times, coverage and buffer.

13
00:01:06,677 --> 00:01:13,129
This one-hundred-dollar product budget allocates
purchases by urgency.

14
00:01:13,129 --> 00:01:22,000
Quotes are selected by the owner, and costs use
exact cents.

15
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:29,615
I save a draft and review its quantities,
suppliers and total.

16
00:01:29,615 --> 00:01:35,154
Shipping, tax and the spending limit are
explicit.

17
00:01:35,154 --> 00:01:40,000
Only the owner can approve this order.

18
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:46,273
Now I approve checkout with a Sandbox Personal
buyer.

19
00:01:46,273 --> 00:01:52,545
The status confirms test funds are held, not
captured.

20
00:01:52,545 --> 00:01:55,333
I separately confirm Capture.

21
00:01:55,333 --> 00:02:03,000
This completes the test payment, while stock
remains unchanged until receiving.

22
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:09,875
For this demo, I simulate goods arriving and
confirm full receipt.

23
00:02:09,875 --> 00:02:13,000
The approved quantities update inventory.

24
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:17,375
The receipt records stock before and after.

25
00:02:17,375 --> 00:02:23,000
Refreshing preserves the receipt without adding
those units again.

26
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:29,947
The assistant also supports editable voice or
typed stock and budget queries.

27
00:02:29,947 --> 00:02:34,000
These previews cannot approve orders or pay.

28
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:37,000
ReSupply connects demand to owner-controlled
purchasing.

29
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:42,000
This prototype uses synthetic data, USD and one
Sandbox merchant.

30
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:45,000
The runnable source is MIT licensed.
